st namespace as its own child jolt\n793:  `step-timeout-ms` in `src/dev/jolt_j2_lane.clj`), so beyond ~16 workers\n801:  timeout and wall-time measurements, native-memory/leak gates, and the\n805:`step-timeout-ms` map with their measured wall time; a namespace timing out\n816:same commit, with a name like `~/ci/datomworld-<name>-dart`:\n926:### Measured times (first runs, 2026-10-11, commit 84c7c9b7, all lanes concurrent)\n937:### Jupiter verification run (2026-10-29, commit 7c0a078f, scratch clone, sequential lanes)\n996:   review before commit applies to remote-produced work identically.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
